#!/usr/bin/python3 -IB
"""Profile-owned Fuzzel launcher and bounded action/menu protocol adapter.

Public picker results: 0 selection, 1 Back, 2 failure, 3 close workflow.
Only the native Fuzzel process owns the interactive wait; readers and cleanup
have separate byte budgets and bounded waits. No shell/configuration is run.
"""
